{"v":1,"id":"d1237878c3d5","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"(Verse 1)","s":14.17,"e":14.35},{"t":"The love of man fades with the day,","s":14.37,"e":17.59},{"t":"Built on need, it slips away.","s":17.66,"e":20.62},{"t":"But You remain when all is gone,","s":20.68,"e":23.97},{"t":"Your whisper pulls my spirit on.","s":24.03,"e":27.37},{"t":"You breathe Your peace into my chest,","s":27.47,"e":30.73},{"t":"A quiet place, a holy rest.","s":30.85,"e":34.36},{"t":"All I am is Yours to keep,","s":34.44,"e":37.31},{"t":"You sing me softly out of sleep.","s":37.39,"e":42.55},{"t":"(Chorus)","s":40.76,"e":42.67},{"t":"Your light in the hollow,","s":42.69,"e":46.06},{"t":"Fills every space.","s":46.1,"e":49.04},{"t":"Your mercy surrounds me,","s":49.12,"e":52.79},{"t":"Your love is grace.","s":52.87,"e":54.18},{"t":"From ashes You lift me,","s":54.21,"e":59.51},{"t":"You call my name —","s":59.61,"e":63.36},{"t":"Unconditional,","s":63.46,"e":66.12},{"t":"Forever the same.","s":66.21,"e":70.85},{"t":"(Verse 2)","s":67.41,"e":70.95},{"t":"The world taught love was just a flame,","s":70.96,"e":74.0},{"t":"That flickers out, that can’t remain.","s":74.06,"e":77.34},{"t":"But You are fire that never dies,","s":77.4,"e":80.68},{"t":"A steady glow that lights the skies.","s":80.8,"e":84.08},{"t":"You warm the coldest part of me,","s":84.13,"e":86.72},{"t":"Your truth restores what used to be.","s":86.82,"e":91.03},{"t":"In Your arms, I finally see,","s":91.14,"e":93.88},{"t":"What love was always meant to be.","s":93.96,"e":97.19},{"t":"(Bridge)","s":96.76,"e":98.19},{"t":"If I must fall, let it be to rise,","s":98.27,"e":104.84},{"t":"To see Your hope in these tired eyes.","s":104.94,"e":111.35},{"t":"Your cup runs over, and I believe,","s":111.43,"e":118.69},{"t":"Your joy is the breath I breathe.","s":118.77,"e":122.78},{"t":"(Final Chorus)","s":122.39,"e":125.78},{"t":"Your light in the hollow,","s":125.84,"e":129.45},{"t":"Breaks through the dark.","s":1